---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { site } from "../data/book.js";
---

<Base title="Your information | The Hanukkah Fairy" description="How The Hanukkah Fairy stores and uses email signups, and what the website measures." path="/privacy" noindex footerKit={false}>
  <div class="wrap privacy-page">
    <a class="text-link" href="/">← Back to The Hanukkah Fairy</a>
    <p class="eyebrow">For the grown-ups</p>
    <h1>Your information.</h1>
    <p>This site is run by The Hanukkah Fairy LLC.</p>
    <p>
      When you ask for The Fairy’s 8 Night Kit, we save your email address, the time you signed up, a record that you agreed to receive emails from The Hanukkah Fairy, and which button on the site you used. If you answer the optional question about who you read with, we save that answer too.
    </p>
    <p>
      If you joined the list before November 2026 and chose to give your name, mailing address or phone number, those details are still stored with your signup. We no longer ask for them.
    </p>
    <h2>What the list is for</h2>
    <p>
      News from The Hanukkah Fairy: ideas for the eight nights, the book, the characters and future plush announcements. Updates are sent by email. Signing up does not place an order or reserve a product.
    </p>
    <h2>Where your signup goes</h2>
    <p>
      Your email address is added to our mailing list at Mailchimp, the service we use to send emails. A copy of your signup is also kept in a private file with Vercel, our website and storage provider. The list is not publicly downloadable from this website. We don’t sell it or share it for advertising.
    </p>
    <h2>What the website measures</h2>
    <p>
      This site loads Google Tag Manager so we can count visits and see which pages and buttons are useful, such as which button opened the kit form or which bookstore link was chosen. We don’t send your email address to it. Your browser also remembers, on your own device, that you have the kit or closed the kit reminder, so we don’t keep asking.
    </p>
    <h2>Links to bookstores</h2>
    <p>
      Buttons to Amazon, Apple Books, Barnes &amp; Noble, Audible, Spotify and the Fairy Gift Shop take you to those companies’ websites, which have their own privacy policies. As an Amazon Associate, The Hanukkah Fairy earns from qualifying purchases.
    </p>
    <h2>For adults</h2>
    <p>
      This signup is for parents and other grown-ups. Please use your own email address. We don’t ask for children’s names, ages, or email addresses.
    </p>
    <h2>Changing your mind</h2>
    <p>
      To leave the list or have your details removed, use the unsubscribe link at the bottom of any email, or contact
      <a href={site.instagram} target="_blank" rel="noopener">@thehanukkahfairy on Instagram</a>. You can ask at any time.
    </p>
    <p>Last updated November 11, 2026.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
